      "content": "That's a bit vague for what I need. They're definitely going to ask about the specifics of the data processing patent. They've heard rumors about some potential legal friction or reviews regarding its validity. If they bring up the pending challenge, how should I handle that to keep them from backing out of the $1.2B valuation?",
